  "bridgeVersion": "0.8.24 with temporary probe action (not included in production plugin)",
  "findings": [
    "Document.InsertObject accepts the primitive names loader and list and returns initialized document objects; bridge requests continue after creation.",
    "The initial CreateChild+AddChild Loader probe wrote XML but Document.OnUpdate then threw NullReferenceException and the bridge stopped responding. That route was abandoned in the disposable copy.",
    "List.AddItem creates preview children but leaves items empty and does not serialize item elements.",
    "Appending ListItemData entries to the items collection serializes them; assigning the collection back to items also rebuilds visible preview children.",
    "The omitted autoItemSize XML default is true for column/row layouts and false for flow_hz/flow_vt/pagination.",
    "Readback steps labelled sameProcessReadback are snapshots, not proof of a fresh process. Production restart verification is recorded separately in p8-7-creation-live.json."
  ]
